[en.FOCUS_GEN_IDEOLOGY_POWER]
Reinforce Power

[en.FOCUS_GEN_IDEOLOGY_POWER_desc]
Money is Mr.Cake’s Hayburger that starts falling apart after 10 moons. Power is the old stone building that stands for centuries.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_IDEOLOGY_POWER]
巩固权力

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_IDEOLOGY_POWER_desc]
金钱是蛋糕先生的干草汉堡，十个露娜月后就会垮掉。权力则是古老的石建筑，矗立了数个世纪。

